WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.730
- [Narrator] Elephantiasis
is a disease spread

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.090
through mosquitoes.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.870
Worldwide, over 120 million
people are infected,

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.890
and the largest number
of those are in India.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.760
Its symptoms are unmissable.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.270
The most extreme being
swelling in the extremities

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.493
that can leave people disfigured for life.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.390
Most people assume that
elephantiasis is untreatable,

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.890
but in fact, the opposite is true.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.983
And in India, the race is
on to eradicate it forever.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.610
Rather than cities, the
largest rates of infection

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.120
are in villages,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.710
but there are people on the front lines,

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:43.320
like Sheila and Pratima,

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.270
who both work for the Ministry of Health,

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.853
and who go by foot-village
to village-to help.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.960
Their days start extremely early

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.620
as they head out to meet and treat people

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.093
across northern India.

00:00:56.691 --> 00:00:59.441
(speaking Hindi)

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.700
Mosquitoes carry the disease,

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.440
so all it takes is one bite

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.373
and a person can become infected.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.010
However, the disease has a period

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:49.700
where it's 100 percent treatable,

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.590
and the key is getting the medication

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.670
that cures it to people early.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.390
But it's an uphill battle,

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.269
and for many it's already too late.

00:01:58.269 --> 00:02:01.019
(speaking Hindi)

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.600
But, change is happening.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:25.567
And rates of infection
across India are decreasing.

00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:28.317
(speaking Hindi)

